  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "clm:38a4a56a01589cfcfe574248a55b70f44119b6a0b3bb03349eb4dee3df196d85",
      "text": "Both PMM setup and Operator documentation warn that moving or renaming active log files can interrupt mongolog collection. Validate rotation behavior when diagnosing missing QAN data. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
      "also": [
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-operator-for-mongodb/1.23.1/monitoring.html",
        "https://forums.percona.com/t/pmm3-mongodb-2-questions-about-mongodb-mongolog-agent-and-query-analytics-panel/40045"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9d55c825bc7dbc6527a9cfe92b350ef7ce096fe238bb2cb011b63593287c2405",
        "ev:f3300f6e6555034faf95f949be5e6223f70124a52eb565b77cfe8877b65a613e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:1ef97bf6bd6011e87e49551da2dea91aeed9b7401c264a85c095591ea3ef84b0",
      "text": "Interpret Percona\u2019s identical-analytics wording as feature/data comparability, not guaranteed identical operation coverage. This inference follows because level-2 profiling captures all operations, whereas normal diagnostic logging follows a threshold and sample rate; filters can further change selection. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/tutorial/manage-the-database-profiler/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:4a4b35af5b536869a9a76e5d8c8a4683b1b129203a3ffcfbfdefa0fa3ec9c31c",
        "ev:9d55c825bc7dbc6527a9cfe92b350ef7ce096fe238bb2cb011b63593287c2405",
        "ev:afae5026efa86ebed0b8fd07d1329bdde18d10711c999ac072905d69dc96c00a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:89ee9618e5563cde9ef424ccf05a51db4afb58c6c287369e6d0edbd424dba0c8",
      "text": "Mongolog can run with profiling mode off. Do not infer identical operation coverage: level-2 profiling records all operations, whereas slow-log collection follows configured logging selection. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/tutorial/manage-the-database-profiler/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:4a4b35af5b536869a9a76e5d8c8a4683b1b129203a3ffcfbfdefa0fa3ec9c31c",
        "ev:9d55c825bc7dbc6527a9cfe92b350ef7ce096fe238bb2cb011b63593287c2405",
        "ev:afae5026efa86ebed0b8fd07d1329bdde18d10711c999ac072905d69dc96c00a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:c1e014bf75e007e6670d5fa040c7a2de98bde5e8a8710c06fbe119ef291be50d",
      "text": "PMM documents mongolog support for mongos; MongoDB cannot enable its database profiler on mongos, although diagnostic slow-operation logging remains available. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/tutorial/manage-the-database-profiler/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:3e7a6e131332d11f0840e61811bbfa23c360210e59db2d0db5675d75fd5f417e",
        "ev:9d55c825bc7dbc6527a9cfe92b350ef7ce096fe238bb2cb011b63593287c2405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:a689ef3a8bbc4f53133286e699b3e6e0e8fd1dfb2bf4f930d937dadbd99761eb",
      "text": "Mongolog requires file-based slow-operation logging, MongoDB write access to its log file, PMM Agent read access, and appropriate database privileges. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/percona/pmm/blob/main/documentation/docs/use/qan/QAN-stored-metrics.md",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:f6f0d913ffd1270602cb84e6355be800dc4b3ec416a11c8d5111d9ab9125bece"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:fb8f25a7fa90fbbfb59a83b69c19217ac77dad2a6dc979f5f8a40e0132fccb33",
      "text": "A June 2, 2026 user report on PMM Server/Client 3.7.1 describes getCmdLineOpts failing during slow WiredTiger recovery, followed by STARTING \u2192 STOPPING \u2192 DONE without retry. This is an unconfirmed version-specific report, not proof of a current defect. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-06-02)",
      "source_url": "https://forums.percona.com/t/pmm3-mongodb-2-questions-about-mongodb-mongolog-agent-and-query-analytics-panel/40045",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:05dc9ee7dfc66ff3feef37acecdc440e4977632a05f1c04f6035980f2fc42741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:1ddd6789ed128ce55a290baa485e8122de77695473b4f869038569a93ddf16e8",
      "text": "Datadog independently documents collecting MongoDB slow operations from system.profile when profiling is enabled, or via getLog when disabled. Its warning about a 1,024-event getLog buffer belongs to that API-based collector and must not be assigned to PMM\u2019s file-tailing mongolog source. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.datadoghq.com/database_monitoring/setup_mongodb/selfhosted/",
      "also": [
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/release-notes/3.3.0.html"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9d55c825bc7dbc6527a9cfe92b350ef7ce096fe238bb2cb011b63593287c2405",
        "ev:a2a169c90e397a1a1a5ce374e12515a926b4f9203df1d0f9e719ded83f8f8b26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:6edd0caed1440d322601006a2f02beff5a30c9839d95693a2bb002ac8145ee14",
      "text": "Log collection can run with operationProfiling.mode: off and a configured slowOpThresholdMs. MongoDB must write to a file and PMM Agent must be able to read it. Disabling system.profile collection does not disable diagnostic slow-operation logging. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
      "also": [
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-operator-for-mongodb/1.23.1/monitoring.html",
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/tutorial/manage-the-database-profiler/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9d55c825bc7dbc6527a9cfe92b350ef7ce096fe238bb2cb011b63593287c2405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:35b14ae8b0fbc49f1849a38db095124c55b39ff928ea348a41c83c58a86b63f7",
      "text": "Percona attributes reduced connection contention to reading files instead of querying databases for QAN. This scopes the benefit to query collection; it does not establish that all PMM components need zero connections or that logging has zero server cost. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/release-notes/3.3.0.html",
      "also": [
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/tutorial/manage-the-database-profiler/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:4c34dc444b4854c22bc44233ce959c212ac7ed84d40e60e7ab35aa3cfd3670c9",
        "ev:9d55c825bc7dbc6527a9cfe92b350ef7ce096fe238bb2cb011b63593287c2405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:236cdd930399de2c3bcb7664dde27ebc3cb4a854d6520329d46e1e47eed09517",
      "text": "PMM mongolog reads MongoDB diagnostic log files for QAN; the profiler source instead reads per-database system.profile collections. An analytics interface therefore need not depend on enabling the database profiler. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
      "also": [
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-operator-for-mongodb/1.23.1/monitoring.html",
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/tutorial/manage-the-database-profiler/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9d55c825bc7dbc6527a9cfe92b350ef7ce096fe238bb2cb011b63593287c2405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:9659b7883506cba181801791c35eac91035dd4449ded2693b3596238d4edd9ed",
      "text": "Select log collection with pmm-admin add mongodb --query-source=mongolog. The command reference lists profiler as the default, with mongolog and none as alternatives. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/percona/pmm/blob/main/documentation/docs/use/commands/pmm-admin/add.md",
      "also": [
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/release-notes/3.3.0.html"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:5b8155f66329faf5d720e78032c0164d01b7a4d84c92f91fab38645b3a2e7137",
        "ev:f1c1434c9f64d37e38c354bf7a64baa674c66cb9433f686e84f25f325d2929f1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:e9e61c298c79391ddb44060c26ee1a0720247c5e174705eb716b77332a030263",
      "text": "Official release notes introduce mongolog in PMM 3.3.0, released July 9, 2025; a forum reply naming 3.2.0 conflicts with that primary release record. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2025-07-09)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/release-notes/3.3.0.html",
      "also": [
        "https://forums.percona.com/t/pmm-prevents-mongodb-from-accepting-connections-randomly/39530"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:4c34dc444b4854c22bc44233ce959c212ac7ed84d40e60e7ab35aa3cfd3670c9",
        "ev:f47adcb89fd662640e5baa60dcc540282d29062bdc51e0da383065234ee449db"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:174507a0df3fcb546285df2930446932cd1a42bcadfc26edb82a1194872c65ed",
      "text": "Mongolog avoids continuous profiler polling, but still connects at startup to discover the log path; its documented privileges include clusterMonitor or getCmdLineOpts. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html",
      "also": [
        "https://github.com/percona/pmm/blob/main/documentation/docs/use/qan/QAN-stored-metrics.md"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9d55c825bc7dbc6527a9cfe92b350ef7ce096fe238bb2cb011b63593287c2405",
        "ev:f6f0d913ffd1270602cb84e6355be800dc4b3ec416a11c8d5111d9ab9125bece"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:10ec057488caeabb94ac2486998b702a2e5463daf55f93178cfb94b4795ae3a1",
      "text": "Operator issue 2363 reports open /data/db/mongod.log: no such file or directory with PMM3 on Operator 1.21.2, and working mongolog collection after 1.22.0 mounted the data PVC. Treat this as reporter-tested evidence, not a universal upgrade guarantee. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-05-28)",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/percona/percona-server-mongodb-operator/issues/2363",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:b3a324e5b9c7102189cbd59679b31dca486445a5063663cb8ad37ca289348046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:2bece8859c67c5de1a2e6203a4f3a1697d3988a32182ef0cdc21cb92b353e646",
      "text": "Percona's July 23, 2026 Operator 1.23.0 announcement lists choosing mongolog as a QAN source under K8SPSMDB-1546. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-07-23)",
      "source_url": "https://www.percona.com/blog/percona-operator-for-mongodb-1-23-0-clustersync-vector-search-pvc-snapshot-backups/",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:b08fb1e84284b3ddc8ab8f2654def3309606cb3e4a6abab2874463250674347f",
        "ev:de6c24bc2bde7e3cf05acb6d2ae991eedfe9bfb83d635b324ea88ec0f16cb40c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:0c7f95ec3bdad667e8f219c052d7f9b6025f33f3eb971ea096eabf28d6e1f3b1",
      "text": "PMM distinguishes stored QAN for completed queries from real-time analytics for running operations. Selecting mongolog changes the stored-query input source; it does not itself provide an in-flight operation view. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://www.percona.com/blog/what-is-running-on-my-mongodb-right-now-real-time-analytics-in-pmm/",
      "also": [
        "https://github.com/percona/pmm/blob/main/documentation/docs/use/qan/QAN-stored-metrics.md"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:4c35d33a3cab0ad87896994eedab830322dfbb58da734d46d341dd91c0e6f973",
        "ev:6fdd81f5c0f7902f72e58dc28d702ac512e862558891708b86f2004c068fa5b8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:a7bf5f20601fecb51286cb3c932abd30522f3082b2941fab407000346db265f0",
      "text": "PMM 3.3.0, released July 9, 2025, introduced mongolog as an alternative query source intended to reduce monitoring connection pressure in deployments with many databases. (high confidence) (verified as of 2025-07-09)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/release-notes/3.3.0.html",
      "also": [
        "https://docs.percona.com/percona-monitoring-and-management/3/install-pmm/install-pmm-client/connect-database/mongodb.html"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:4c34dc444b4854c22bc44233ce959c212ac7ed84d40e60e7ab35aa3cfd3670c9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:faa715533e094f7570c81ab668e467eb24db4ab3ab4d89037851cab9f1d2397a",
      "text": "Operator 1.23.1 documentation says mongolog support was added in Operator 1.23.0, requires PMM 3.3.0 or newer, and needs logcollector enabled so PMM can read logs under /data/db/logs/; select it with spec.pmm.querySource: mongolog. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-07-10)",
      "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-operator-for-mongodb/1.23.1/monitoring.html",
